# Party strength for Glacia (trainer_parties.h:3423 gTrainerParty_Glacia: GLALIE 50, SEALEO 50, SEALEO 52, GLALIE 52, WALREIN 53).
# No Pokemon Center between the League's rooms: a player restores HP and PP from the bag between battles (the bag
# holds Full Restores, 38); auto_battle uses no items, so each room's boost does it: the level (HP full, stats
# recomputed) and the lead's four moves set again (PP full). The moves: TM26 Earthquake, HM03 Surf, TM13 Ice Beam
# and HM07 Waterfall, all in Marshtomp's TM/HM learnset (src/data/pokemon/tmhm_learnsets.h:6289-6299).
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 2 MOVE_ICE_BEAM
party-move 0 3 MOVE_WATERFALL
party-level 0 76
